<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea to import 63 mln bbls of crude oil in June.</title>
<headline>S.Korea to import 63 mln bbls of crude oil in June.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korean oil refiners plan to import 63 million barrels of crude oil this month against an estimated 65 million barrels last month, an energy ministry official said on Monday.  </p>
<p>Despite a slight month-on-month decrease, this month's scheduled crude imports is still a sharp increase from 49 million barrels of crude bought in June 1996 due to capacity expansion.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
